<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA MONEY MKT SHORTAGE AT 9.031 BLN RAND THUR.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA MONEY MKT SHORTAGE AT 9.031 BLN RAND THUR.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said the money market shortage rose to 9.031 billion rand on Thursday from 8.446 billion rand on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
